      "text": "\n$\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zjAxL",
      "text": "\n$\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{4}, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$\n",
