  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$f(x)$ is defined if $-1 \\leq \\frac{x}{2}-1 \\leq 1$ and $\\cos x>0$ \nor $0 \\leq x \\leq 4$ and $-\\frac{\\pi}{2} < x < \\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{x} \\in\\left[0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) \\text {. }$",
